@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@customerCookie = sb_session=replace-with-cookie-from-login
@sellerCookie = sb_session=replace-with-seller-cookie
@adminCookie = sb_session=replace-with-admin-cookie
@productId = p001
@addressId = addr-1
@orderId = SB-000001
@checkoutReference = SB-CHECKOUT-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@prescriptionId = RX-000001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "API Test Customer",
  "email": "api-customer@example.test",
  "password": "CustomerPassword123"
}

### Login customer (copy sb_session from Set-Cookie into @customerCookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@shusthobazaar.demo",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### Current session
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?q=omeprazole&category=Gastric&page=1&limit=10

### Product detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Read active cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Add cart item
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update cart quantity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove cart item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Apply coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/coupon
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME10"
}

### Remove coupon
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/coupon
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Clear cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### List saved addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Add address
POST {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Home",
  "recipient": "Aminul Islam",
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "street": "House 42, Road 11, Banani",
  "city": "Dhaka",
  "postalCode": "1213"
}

### Checkout with Cash on Delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "cod"
}

### Checkout with a persisted local mock payment (copy checkoutReference from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "mock"
}

### Complete mock payment (success or failed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/mock/complete
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkoutReference": "{{checkoutReference}}",
  "result": "success"
}

### List my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Order details and status history
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Advance order status (use seller or admin cookie; valid transitions only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Get/generate invoice JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Reject an order with a reason (seller/admin; restocks the items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/reject
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Out of stock at this branch"
}

### Seller dashboard (admins may add ?sellerId=s003)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/dashboard
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}

### Seller inventory, including hidden products
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/products
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}

### Create a product (admins must also send "sellerId": "s002")
POST {{baseUrl}}/seller/products
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Napa Syrup",
  "generic": "Paracetamol 120mg/5ml",
  "categoryId": "c1",
  "price": 45,
  "stock": 30,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5,
  "requiresPrescription": false,
  "image": "/images/napa-extra-paracetamol-box-and-tablet-strip.webp"
}

### Update price, stock or listing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/seller/products/{{productId}}
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 36,
  "stock": 140,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Delete a product that has never been ordered
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/seller/products/p023
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}

### Upload a prescription (JPEG, PNG or PDF, max 5 MB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=rx

--rx
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="prescription.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./public/logo.png
--rx--

### My prescriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}

### Checkout a cart with prescription-only products
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "cod",
  "prescriptionId": "{{prescriptionId}}"
}

### Seller verification queue (?status=pending|approved|rejected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/reviews?status=pending
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}

### Approve a prescription
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/reviews/{{orderId}}
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approved"
}

### Reject a prescription with a reason
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/reviews/{{orderId}}
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "rejected",
  "reason": "The prescription date is not readable."
}

### Send a new prescription after a rejection (customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/prescription
Cookie: {{customerCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prescriptionId": "RX-000002"
}

### View a prescription file
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/{{prescriptionId}}/file
Cookie: {{sellerCookie}}
